{"id":"00ba4d3d5719420e","group":"27","path":"27/27-thm-quine.md","title":"Prime implicants from consensus closure","display":"thm-quine — Prime implicants from consensus closure","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-thm-quine","aliases":["27-thm-quine"],"display":"thm-quine — Prime implicants from consensus closure","depends_on":["[[27-df-dnf]]","[[27-df-consensusclosure]]","[[27-df-piset]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§3.2.2 Theorem 3.5, Corollary 3.2","source_printed_pages":"132–134","source_pdf_pages":"156–158","verification_status":"source-statement-and-proof-structure-checked"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-thm-quine"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-thm-quine</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-quine — Prime implicants from consensus closure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0b618255959ff4bc\" href=\"?note=0b618255959ff4bc\" title=\"27-df-dnf\">27-df-dnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7d5c58a3a73488b3\" href=\"?note=7d5c58a3a73488b3\" title=\"27-df-consensusclosure\">27-df-consensusclosure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§3.2.2 Theorem 3.5, Corollary 3.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"132–134"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"156–158"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-and-proof-structure-checked"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\">\\(D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\">\\(f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{QCl},\\preceq\">\\(\\mathrm{QCl},\\preceq\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"7d5c58a3a73488b3\" href=\"?note=7d5c58a3a73488b3\" title=\"27-df-consensusclosure\">27-df-consensusclosure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}\">\\(\\mathrm{PI}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" href=\"?note=3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2\" title=\"27-df-piset\">27-df-piset</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PI}(f)=\\{T\\in\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\mid\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\;(T\\preceq U\\Rightarrow T=U)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{PI}(f)=\\{T\\in\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\mid\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\;(T\\preceq U\\Rightarrow T=U)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>consensus 保持表示的函数，并且书中 Theorem 3.5 证明闭包含全部 prime implicants；吸收所有非极大项便恰得 complete DNF。闭包有限，故这是实际可终止的生成过程。已比对定理陈述、两种证明的结构及 Lemmas 3.3–3.6；未声称任何多项式输入总时间界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-dnf","status":"resolved","id":"0b618255959ff4bc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-dnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consensusclosure","status":"resolved","id":"7d5c58a3a73488b3","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-consensusclosure]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-piset]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-consensusclosure","status":"resolved","id":"7d5c58a3a73488b3","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$；$\\mathrm{QCl},\\preceq$ 见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]，$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-piset","status":"resolved","id":"3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$；$\\mathrm{QCl},\\preceq$ 见 [[27-df-consensusclosure]]，$\\mathrm{PI}$ 见 [[27-df-piset]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"D\\in\\mathrm{DNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{QCl},\\preceq","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{PI}(f)=\\{T\\in\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\mid\\forall U\\in\\mathrm{QCl}(D)\\;(T\\preceq U\\Rightarrow T=U)\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":1388,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-538","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-thm-quine|thm-quine — Prime implicants from consensus closure]]"},{"id":"dad46c0d84937bbd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"42ced58db8330b9d","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$f\\in\\mathrm{QuadFunc}_n$（see [[27-df-quadfunc]]）；$\\mathrm{PI}(f)$（see [[27-df-piset]]），$\\mathrm{Lits}$ 取 quadratic-DNF 接口中的含义；consensus 生成 prime implicants 的结果（see [[27-thm-quine]]）。"}],"outgoing":["0b618255959ff4bc","7d5c58a3a73488b3","3e2ce4e4d23a0ce2"]}